## 📌 Pin Layouts

### 📡 nRF24L01+ Modules (Shared SPI + Individual CE/CSN)
All three nRF24 modules share the same SPI bus (`SCK`, `MOSI`, `MISO`) and power lines, while using separate `CE` and `CSN` pins:

| Module / Pin | ESP32 GPIO | Notes |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **VCC** | `3.3V` | Use a dedicated 3.3V regulator (e.g., LF33) |
| **GND** | `GND` | Common ground |
| **SCK** | `GPIO 18` | Shared across all nRF24 modules |
| **MOSI** | `GPIO 23` | Shared across all nRF24 modules |
| **MISO** | `GPIO 19` | Shared across all nRF24 modules |
| **IRQ** | `Not Connected` | Unused |
| **Radio 1 - CE** | `GPIO 5` | Primary module |
| **Radio 1 - CSN** | `GPIO 17` | Primary module (TX2) |
| **Radio 2 - CE** | `GPIO 16` | Secondary module (RX2) |
| **Radio 2 - CSN** | `GPIO 4` | Secondary module |
| **Radio 3 - CE** | `GPIO 15` | Tertiary module |
| **Radio 3 - CSN** | `GPIO 2` | Tertiary module |

